9. The product should output distributions, not prophecy

This is crucial.

Never:

TSLA will be $472.

Instead:

30-day distribution
Bear regime       18%
Neutral regime    47%
Bull regime       28%
Tail upside         7%

And conditional predictions:

IF deliveries miss >8%
AND gross margin falls
AND narrative remains "AI company":
Probability of -10% / 5 trading days: 64%

Then track calibration.

If we say “70%” one hundred times, approximately seventy should happen.

Use:

* Brier score
* log loss
* calibration error
* directional accuracy
* expected-return calibration
* regime-specific accuracy
* maximum drawdown if deployed as strategy

No mystical victory declarations.

Scoreboard.

